Pitako composes third-party Pi packages and vendors selected MIT skills.

Dependencies (not copied into this repository's source):

- pi-lsp-client (code-yeongyu) is MIT. Its NOTICE explains that the ported LSP
  tools were re-licensed by their author for the Pi ecosystem. Oh My OpenAgent
  itself remains under a different license and is not shipped here.
- @vndv/pi-codegraph is MIT.
- @colbymchenry/codegraph is MIT.
- @dietrichgebert/ponytail is MIT. Pitako loads the ponytail and ponytail-review skills only.
- @juicesharp/rpiv-todo is MIT. Pitako loads the extension as the session TODO layer.
- pi-web-access 0.45.0 (Nico Bailon) is MIT. Pitako bundles it for web search and page extraction. The license is docs/licenses/pi-web-access-LICENSE.
- pi-hermes-memory 0.9.11 (Chandra Teja) is MIT. Pitako bundles it unchanged for persistent memory and conversation search, separate from the Board. The license is docs/licenses/pi-hermes-memory-LICENSE.
- billion-context-pi 0.1.83 (ranxianglei) is MIT. Pitako uses it for ACP context
  compression: https://github.com/ranxianglei/billion-context-pi. Its license is
  docs/licenses/billion-context-pi-LICENSE.
- Pitako uses acp-kernel 0.0.98 (ranxianglei), bundled inline by billion-context-pi:
  https://github.com/ranxianglei/acp-kernel. Its MIT license includes an additional
  Attribution on Product Surfaces term, retained in docs/licenses/acp-kernel-LICENSE.
  Visible attribution is also in README.md and THIRD_PARTY.md.
- Pi (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent) is MIT.
- pi-codex-tools 0.4.0 is Apache-2.0 and includes parser/grammar behavior derived from OpenAI Codex, Copyright 2025 OpenAI. Its attribution is retained in docs/licenses/pi-codex-tools-NOTICE; the license is docs/licenses/pi-codex-tools-LICENSE.

Vendored MIT material (see THIRD_PARTY.md and docs/licenses/):

- Caveman coding skills (Julius Brussee). skills/ is MIT. BSL engine/runtime
  paths are not shipped.
- Selected pstack skills and principles (Lauren Tan / official Cursor pstack
  plugin). Orchestration, poteto-mode, and subagent runtimes are not shipped.

